# Timed sleep refresh verification walk.
# 1. Enables timed refresh at 1-hour interval via CMD:SETTINGS
# 2. Screenshots home to confirm normal boot
# 3. Presses POWER (LEFT physical btn) to enter sleep
# 4. Expects the timer arm log line confirming the wakeup timer was set
#
# Device must be on USB. The walk does NOT wait for the actual timer wake
# (that would take 1 hour); the log line is the verifiable contract.
#
#   uv run python scripts/device_walk.py run scripts/walks/timed-refresh-verify.walk --outdir runs/timed-refresh

shot 01-home-normal-boot
press LEFT 3.0
shot 02-sleep-screen
expect 30 Arming timer wakeup
